This unnamed island is the sixth island that {{Ash}}, {{an|Iris}}, and {{an|Cilan}} visited during their travels through the [[Decolore Islands]]. It was featured in ''[[BW129|The Pirates of Decolore!]]''.

When a pirate gang containing a {{p|Croconaw}}, {{p|Azumarill}}, {{p|Octillery}}, and {{p|Ducklett}} stole food on the ferry Ash and his friends were on, [[Porter]] took the group to this island, where they told an [[Officer Jenny]] about the pirate gang. She tagged along to find them. Meanwhile, the pirate gang stole more supplies on the island and got away on a stolen boat to a [[Second unnamed island (BW129)|neighboring island]] where they had their hideout. Ash sent out his {{AP|Charizard}} earlier to search for the thieves and found them on the other island.

When the thieves lost to [[Ash's Pignite]] and {{AP|Snivy}}, they returned everything stolen to the island.

